id: divine-summoning
name: Divine Summoning
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCostPerBaseTier: 2
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
# A Domain Maneuver (God of a Domain (3)), a God Maneuver: open while the Domain in brackets is yours, only in God Ki, paid in Divine Ki Points.
godManeuver: true
# Which Minions, ticked; 2(bT) Divine Ki each past the first (chat.mjs divineSummoning). Where they are placed: the table's (its Squares).
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Calling your subordinates into battle, you lead with heavenly insight and strategic might.
text: >
  Divine Summoning [1/Round]: Calling your subordinates into battle, you lead with heavenly insight and strategic might.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –Minions: N/A
  –DKP Cost: 2(bT) for each Minion targeted
  –Effect: Target any number of your Minions. Place them on any unoccupied Square(s) on the Battlefield. If this places a Minion on a Square adjacent to an Opponent, this triggers that Minion's Exploit Maneuver. Only one Minion can use the Exploit Maneuver through this effect.

---

[on used]
divineSummoning();
